        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises FEI-WS-75  Modern Wall Mount Door Stop 3-1/2 inch</b>\r\n<p>\r\nConstructed of solid brass, this modern style wall mount door stop adds a touch of sophistication to any room.  It is equally suited for use in private residential or commercial applications.\r\n</p>\r\nThe wall mount design provides excellent protection for your walls and door hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe large 1-1/2\" door stop base attaches to your wall, baseboard or door with three (3) #6 x 1\" screws for a very solid mounting. </p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Field Enterprises FEI-WS-75 Modern Wall Mount Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Diameter:  1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length:  3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material:  Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Screws:  #6 x 1\" screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
